                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "As far as physics-based puzzle games go, this is a decent one.\n\nWhile it does involve some trial and error and luck, there is also quite a bit of planning and clever use of the game mechanics involved.\n\nThe look and feel are quite pleasant.\n\nThe golden line (an extra line you can use if you're struggling to solve a level within the required number of lines), as well as the achievements for solving levels with fewer than the required number of lines, are nice touches.\n",
